The [[Poison Spear]] is a neutral item normally obtained by combining a [[Spear]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]]. When compared with the [[Spear]], it does massively more damage and destroys more {{icon/block}}, with the added upside that [[Nature]] items can occupy the {{icon/star}} slots in addition to the standard option of leaving them free. 

On hit, it also inflicts {{icon/poison}} to '''both''' players, but more to the opponent, which is good in general for dealing damage, but even better in a build with payoff for poisoning the opponent ([[Poison Ivy]], [[Death Scythe]], [[Critical Poison]] etc...). It helps to have a way to cleanse the self-inflicted {{icon/poison}}, like [[Holy Armor]]. Consider the synergy with [[Harold, the Hateful Hat]] if playing [[Mage]].


